579
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:09,480
We actually wanted to vote earlier.

580
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:11,120
But we kept

581
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:13,640
waiting for a starry night.

582
00:15:13,640 --> 00:15:15,200
But it kept being cloudy.

583
00:15:15,200 --> 00:15:16,290
So we kept putting it off.

584
00:15:16,640 --> 00:15:17,160
Yeah.

585
00:15:18,720 --> 00:15:19,760
Bohan's here.

586
00:15:20,510 --> 00:15:22,060
You're writing another letter?

587
00:15:22,080 --> 00:15:23,460
(In a bit)
Old-school romance.

588
00:15:23,460 --> 00:15:24,140
Bring the camera over.

589
00:15:24,140 --> 00:15:24,860
I'll take a couple pictures of you.

590
00:15:24,860 --> 00:15:25,790
Okay.

591
00:15:25,790 --> 00:15:26,320
Yeah.

592
00:15:26,320 --> 00:15:27,070
I'll take photos first.

593
00:15:27,070 --> 00:15:28,360
Photos first. Okay.

594
00:15:28,750 --> 00:15:29,300
Okay.

595
00:15:29,300 --> 00:15:30,620
So cute.

596
00:15:31,780 --> 00:15:33,070
Send it to the hospital.

597
00:15:33,280 --> 00:15:34,030
That's actually genius.

598
00:15:34,030 --> 00:15:34,980
But if I do this,

599
00:15:34,980 --> 00:15:36,670
do you think Xing would think

600
00:15:36,670 --> 00:15:38,110
I'm being a little extra?

601
00:15:38,400 --> 00:15:39,640
(Why is he so cute?)
Would you, Xing?

602
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:42,040
No, not at all.

603
00:15:42,040 --> 00:15:42,990
It's cute.

604
00:15:42,990 --> 00:15:44,310
You're good. Don't worry.

605
00:15:44,310 --> 00:15:45,690
Trust me, girls eat this stuff up.

606
00:15:46,400 --> 00:15:47,520
(Isn't that kind of extra?)
Yeah, girls really do.

607
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:49,920
Xing definitely does.

608
00:15:49,920 --> 00:15:51,280
So what kind of style

609
00:15:51,280 --> 00:15:52,360
do you like on him?

610
00:15:54,120 --> 00:15:54,920
Honestly, this look.

611
00:15:54,920 --> 00:15:55,680
I like it.

612
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:56,560
Clean and simple.

613
00:15:56,560 --> 00:15:57,880
Clean and simple?

614
00:15:57,880 --> 00:15:58,920
Kind of boyish too.

615
00:15:58,920 --> 00:15:59,880
Boyish.

616
00:16:03,440 --> 00:16:04,760
God, this feels kind of extra.

617
00:16:05,320 --> 00:16:06,050
Extra?

618
00:16:06,210 --> 00:16:06,900
A little.

619
00:16:06,900 --> 00:16:07,540
Just write it.

620
00:16:07,540 --> 00:16:08,320
Go ahead.

621
00:16:11,600 --> 00:16:13,040
Looking good.

622
00:16:13,040 --> 00:16:14,520
You still have that picture?

623
00:16:14,520 --> 00:16:15,280
Yeah.

624
00:16:15,800 --> 00:16:17,680
You know, back then,

625
00:16:17,680 --> 00:16:18,400
I honestly thought

626
00:16:18,400 --> 00:16:19,680
he wasn't having a good time there.

627
00:16:19,680 --> 00:16:20,080
Having a good time?

628
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:20,640
Yeah, you looked so serious.

629
00:16:20,640 --> 00:16:21,480
Oh. I wasn't having a good time.

630
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:22,760
I had no idea

631
00:16:22,760 --> 00:16:24,160
you were cracking up
right before writing the letter.

632
00:16:26,240 --> 00:16:27,040
Watching it back now,

633
00:16:27,040 --> 00:16:28,480
you actually seemed pretty happy.

634
00:16:28,720 --> 00:16:29,480
But if you'd been there,

635
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:30,520
he would've been way happier.

636
00:16:30,520 --> 00:16:31,280
I mean,

637
00:16:31,280 --> 00:16:33,080
he was kind of down those few days.

638
00:16:33,080 --> 00:16:34,360
The study was already taken.

639
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:36,360
Kaiyi, Yiheng, and I took turns.

640
00:16:39,490 --> 00:16:40,810
What'd you do today?

641
00:16:41,160 --> 00:16:42,370
Nothing. Just wrote letters.

642
00:16:43,240 --> 00:16:44,240
What else was I supposed to do?

643
00:16:44,240 --> 00:16:46,160
Xing wasn't there.
What else was he supposed to do?

644
00:16:46,160 --> 00:16:47,080
Just hang around.

645
00:16:47,080 --> 00:16:48,040
Did you get to see

646
00:16:48,040 --> 00:16:48,960
Xing every day?

647
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:49,400
Every day?

648
00:16:49,400 --> 00:16:49,960
Back then...

649
00:16:49,960 --> 00:16:50,920
No, I didn't.

650
00:16:50,920 --> 00:16:51,600
Because I couldn't even

651
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:52,560
sit up yet.

652
00:16:52,560 --> 00:16:53,920
I was stuck in bed all day.

653
00:16:53,920 --> 00:16:55,760
Then writing those letters
must've been...

654
00:16:55,760 --> 00:16:57,680
Yeah. The first day,
I wrote one lying down.

655
00:16:58,600 --> 00:16:59,320
Flat on my back.

656
00:16:59,320 --> 00:17:00,640
That's dedication right here.

657
00:17:00,640 --> 00:17:01,560
The things you do for love.

658
00:17:03,560 --> 00:17:04,350
Is this yours?

659
00:17:05,220 --> 00:17:05,570
Yeah.

660
00:17:06,380 --> 00:17:07,420
When I got back,

661
00:17:07,420 --> 00:17:08,600
you weren't in the stargazing room.

662
00:17:09,140 --> 00:17:09,980
I figured you weren't around,

663
00:17:09,980 --> 00:17:11,140
(so I put on your glasses.)
You two are really working those looks.

664
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:13,400
Xing, is he different

665
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:14,960
when he's with you versus

666
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:15,840
when he's at the house?

667
00:17:15,840 --> 00:17:16,560
Bohan, I mean.

668
00:17:17,280 --> 00:17:18,720
I think at the house, you're...

669
00:17:19,040 --> 00:17:19,920
more relaxed.

670
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:21,080
More relaxed?

671
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:22,960
Yeah, just more chill.

672
00:17:22,960 --> 00:17:23,680
Look how you're sitting.

673
00:17:25,600 --> 00:17:26,720
Not all stiff, right?

674
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:27,680
But right now,

675
00:17:27,680 --> 00:17:29,600
you're still
kind of keeping it together.

676
00:17:30,040 --> 00:17:30,600
Right now?

677
00:17:32,200 --> 00:17:32,760
Sitting up all proper.

678
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:34,880
Because you're not here.

679
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:38,000
Xing, if you were here,

680
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:39,080
he'd have his cologne on.

681
00:17:39,880 --> 00:17:40,880
I'd be showing off.

682
00:17:44,360 --> 00:17:45,560
You're working a pose right now too.

683
00:17:45,560 --> 00:17:46,880
Yang's got one too now.

684
00:17:46,880 --> 00:17:47,760
Wait, what was Yang doing?

685
00:17:47,760 --> 00:17:48,280
This?

686
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:50,800
That's Bohan's signature pose.

687
00:17:50,800 --> 00:17:53,080
We should all do
the signature pose together.

688
00:17:53,080 --> 00:17:53,800
Come on.

689
00:17:53,800 --> 00:17:54,960
You do it, and they'll follow.

690
00:17:55,480 --> 00:17:56,040
How'd it go again?

691
00:17:56,040 --> 00:17:56,920
I forgot.

692
00:17:57,920 --> 00:17:59,120
I think you had your legs crossed too.

693
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:00,040
Like this?

694
00:18:00,520 --> 00:18:00,920
This?

695
00:18:02,840 --> 00:18:03,760
Try it.

696
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:06,280
Yang's actually got it.

697
00:18:06,280 --> 00:18:06,880
Pretty close.

698
00:18:06,880 --> 00:18:07,800
Why does it look so...

699
00:18:08,080 --> 00:18:08,760
sassy?

700
00:18:11,160 --> 00:18:11,720
What else?

701
00:18:11,720 --> 00:18:12,760
Give us another one.

702
00:18:12,760 --> 00:18:14,760
I'm usually pretty casual. See?

703
00:18:14,760 --> 00:18:15,920
Even sitting down,
hands in your pockets?

704
00:18:16,400 --> 00:18:18,160
Yeah, your hands
are always in your pockets.

705
00:18:18,160 --> 00:18:19,680
Sometimes that's like

706
00:18:19,680 --> 00:18:21,880
a nervous habit
when you don't feel secure.

707
00:18:21,880 --> 00:18:22,840
Because Xing isn't here.

708
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:24,560
Exactly.

709
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:26,160
Look, his hands are out now.

710
00:18:26,160 --> 00:18:26,440
Huh.

711
00:18:26,440 --> 00:18:27,160
Do I ever do that around you?

712
00:18:27,160 --> 00:18:28,400
I don't think you do.

713
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:29,040
I don't?

714
00:18:32,420 --> 00:18:33,720
Look at these pictures we took today.

715
00:18:36,240 --> 00:18:37,120
This came out so good!

716
00:18:37,120 --> 00:18:38,160
This one's really good.

717
00:18:38,160 --> 00:18:38,400
Yeah.

718
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:38,760
So good.

719
00:18:38,790 --> 00:18:40,470
You two look so good together.

720
00:18:41,700 --> 00:18:42,460
Of course we do.

721
00:18:44,080 --> 00:18:45,520
Look how proud I look.

722
00:18:47,200 --> 00:18:48,390
How come he looks

723
00:18:48,390 --> 00:18:49,550
so much better next to you?

724
00:18:50,380 --> 00:18:51,600
Guess he just needs

725
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:52,900
the right person next to him.

726
00:18:52,900 --> 00:18:54,220
Seventeen, eighteen, nineteen,

727
00:18:54,220 --> 00:18:54,670
twenty.

728
00:18:54,670 --> 00:18:55,960
- These are all from today?
- Oh my God.

729
00:18:55,960 --> 00:18:57,200
You guys took twenty pictures today?

730
00:18:57,200 --> 00:18:58,730
This was the retro disco one.

731
00:18:58,730 --> 00:18:59,480
Oh my God.

732
00:18:59,480 --> 00:19:00,180
Couples edition.

733
00:19:01,160 --> 00:19:02,600
We took so many.

734
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:05,200
Did you draw on them right away,

735
00:19:05,200 --> 00:19:06,520
or did you add all this later?

736
00:19:06,520 --> 00:19:07,320
I drew them myself.

737
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:08,480
I did...

738
00:19:08,880 --> 00:19:10,440
the butterfly in the top right.

739
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:11,480
He did the one down here.

740
00:19:12,280 --> 00:19:13,920
(Fang, Yang)
That's Fang and Yang, right?

741
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:14,560
Yeah.

742
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:16,120
There are so many.

743
00:19:16,120 --> 00:19:16,800
Oh my God.

744
00:19:16,800 --> 00:19:18,600
She decorated every single one.

745
00:19:19,360 --> 00:19:20,800
Look, between Si and me,

746
00:19:20,800 --> 00:19:22,360
we've got a little heart going.

747
00:19:22,880 --> 00:19:24,320
I remember we took a ton of these.

748
00:19:24,320 --> 00:19:24,760
You did.

749
00:19:26,160 --> 00:19:27,440
These are so cute.

750
00:19:27,440 --> 00:19:28,040
You're good at this.

751
00:19:28,040 --> 00:19:29,280
This is so sweet.

752
00:19:29,280 --> 00:19:30,040
Seriously.

753
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:32,520
It all went by so fast.

754
00:19:32,520 --> 00:19:33,440
Looking at these now,

755
00:19:33,440 --> 00:19:34,800
I'm getting kind of emotional.

756
00:19:34,800 --> 00:19:35,560
Oh no.

757
00:19:35,560 --> 00:19:37,040
Am I going to be the first one to cry?

758
00:19:37,040 --> 00:19:38,000
Stop.

759
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:39,280
I'm not crying today.

760
00:19:39,600 --> 00:19:40,720
I really want to go back.

761
00:19:40,720 --> 00:19:41,880
Yeah, it all went by so fast.

762
00:19:41,880 --> 00:19:43,480
Every one of these pictures

763
00:19:43,480 --> 00:19:45,120
takes me right back to that day.

764
00:19:45,120 --> 00:19:46,040
You know...

765
00:19:46,040 --> 00:19:46,720
I remember Yu Yang's first day...

766
00:19:46,720 --> 00:19:47,360
Little by little...

767
00:19:47,360 --> 00:19:48,120
He started capturing

768
00:19:48,120 --> 00:19:49,000
all these moments.

769
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:50,080
Yeah.

770
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:50,960
Our happy little house.

771
00:19:51,920 --> 00:19:52,900
We got a message.

772
00:19:53,540 --> 00:19:54,100
What?

773
00:19:54,120 --> 00:19:54,800
Here it is.

774
00:19:55,580 --> 00:19:56,740
(Heart-to-Heart Moment Rules)

775
00:19:56,760 --> 00:19:57,600
Here we go.

776
00:19:57,980 --> 00:19:58,340
Last day...

777
00:19:58,360 --> 00:19:59,130
The last day.

778
00:19:59,130 --> 00:19:59,960
Last day...

779
00:20:00,280 --> 00:20:02,080
We were all completely caught off guard.

780
00:20:02,080 --> 00:20:03,160
None of us knew.

781
00:20:03,480 --> 00:20:03,840
Yeah.

782
00:20:03,840 --> 00:20:05,000
And suddenly, it was over.

783
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:06,120
Yeah, just like that.

784
00:20:06,120 --> 00:20:08,040
Did you guys know at the time?

785
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:09,440
I found out that night

786
00:20:09,440 --> 00:20:10,840
when Si called me.

787
00:20:11,160 --> 00:20:11,960
Same here.

788
00:20:11,960 --> 00:20:13,680
We all found out around the same time.

789
00:20:13,680 --> 00:20:14,520
Right.

790
00:20:15,160 --> 00:20:16,660
Today's the last day.

791
00:20:17,970 --> 00:20:19,560
Tomorrow, you'll decide

792
00:20:19,560 --> 00:20:20,340
where you want

793
00:20:20,890 --> 00:20:22,470
your relationship to go from here.

794
00:20:22,920 --> 00:20:23,590
So basically,

795
00:20:23,590 --> 00:20:25,170
things could change overnight?

796
00:20:26,030 --> 00:20:27,320
How does that even happen?

797
00:20:27,770 --> 00:20:28,660
Hi, boyfriend.

798
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:31,000
Oh, I see what you mean.

799
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:32,400
It's like

800
00:20:32,400 --> 00:20:33,640
today you're still

801
00:20:33,640 --> 00:20:35,040
sitting together,
feeling a little awkward,

802
00:20:35,040 --> 00:20:36,360
but tomorrow, he's your boyfriend.

803
00:20:36,360 --> 00:20:37,720
Fang's already made up her mind.

804
00:20:37,720 --> 00:20:39,360
She's already calling him her boyfriend.

805
00:20:39,560 --> 00:20:40,290
Oh my God.

806
00:20:42,330 --> 00:20:43,450
You've been waiting to say that,
haven't you?

807
00:20:43,830 --> 00:20:45,380
(Liang Renfang)
Just took his name

808
00:20:45,380 --> 00:20:46,630
and added boyfriend to it.

809
00:20:47,760 --> 00:20:48,560
What's going on?

810
00:20:48,560 --> 00:20:49,760
Just have some water to calm down.

811
00:20:49,760 --> 00:20:50,200
Need to calm down.

812
00:20:50,200 --> 00:20:50,720
Okay, calm down.

813
00:20:50,720 --> 00:20:51,120
Let's keep watching.

814
00:20:51,120 --> 00:20:51,640
Keep going.

815
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:54,160
You're holding it so close.

816
00:20:54,160 --> 00:20:56,030
After giving it some thought...

817
00:20:56,040 --> 00:20:57,440
It's almost touching your face.

818
00:20:57,440 --> 00:20:58,540
(Yu Yang)
Choose from the options below

819
00:20:58,540 --> 00:20:59,750
and make your decision.

820
00:20:59,770 --> 00:21:00,920
You read every single word.

821
00:21:01,200 --> 00:21:01,790
I think...

822
00:21:02,250 --> 00:21:03,820
there's really nothing to think about.

823
00:21:03,820 --> 00:21:04,280
Yeah.

824
00:21:04,800 --> 00:21:06,420
I already knew what I wanted.

825
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:08,240
I'd known for a while.

826
00:21:09,880 --> 00:21:11,080
How long?

827
00:21:11,080 --> 00:21:12,160
A long time.

828
00:21:12,160 --> 00:21:13,760
Since when?

829
00:21:14,320 --> 00:21:15,280
You didn't even have to think?

830
00:21:15,560 --> 00:21:16,800
I'd decided a long time ago.

831
00:21:16,800 --> 00:21:18,400
Since I started keeping a journal.

832
00:21:18,840 --> 00:21:20,080
Since our first date?

833
00:21:20,080 --> 00:21:20,880
Yeah.

834
00:21:21,280 --> 00:21:22,160
That night.

835
00:21:22,640 --> 00:21:23,880
That little cat on his cup...

836
00:21:23,880 --> 00:21:24,680
I put it there.

837
00:21:25,640 --> 00:21:26,640
The sun.

838
00:21:26,640 --> 00:21:27,480
And that sign with the sun.

839
00:21:27,480 --> 00:21:28,800
Yeah, the sunflower.

840
00:21:29,630 --> 00:21:30,600
We're definitely going

841
00:21:30,600 --> 00:21:31,550
somewhere really nice.

842
00:21:31,950 --> 00:21:32,900
I think so too.

843
00:21:33,160 --> 00:21:34,840
(Maybe somewhere...)
What am I doing?

844
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:35,680
Somewhere far away.

845
00:21:35,840 --> 00:21:36,600
I was so excited.

846
00:21:36,600 --> 00:21:37,800
(Yeah.)
I couldn't wait. I was ready to go.

847
00:21:37,800 --> 00:21:38,960
(Already imagining it.)
You were already hearing the music.

848
00:21:43,480 --> 00:21:44,200
You...

849
00:21:44,200 --> 00:21:45,460
Three of you are on cloud nine

850
00:21:45,460 --> 00:21:46,420
(Look at those three.)
just thinking about it.

851
00:21:48,070 --> 00:21:48,820
I can't wait.

852
00:21:49,140 --> 00:21:49,640
Yeah.

853
00:21:50,600 --> 00:21:51,520
Here comes 906.

854
00:21:51,920 --> 00:21:53,360
Let's see what you two were like.

855
00:21:56,360 --> 00:21:57,240
What a change in mood.

856
00:21:57,240 --> 00:21:58,320
Yeah, the vibe was totally different.

857
00:22:04,190 --> 00:22:05,410
Now he's getting nervous.

858
00:22:07,560 --> 00:22:08,760
You don't look nervous at all, Bohan.

859
00:22:10,440 --> 00:22:10,760
Bohan,

860
00:22:10,760 --> 00:22:12,680
did you already know what you wanted?

861
00:22:12,680 --> 00:22:14,000
Did you hesitate at all?

862
00:22:14,000 --> 00:22:15,680
I just didn't know how she felt.

863
00:22:15,680 --> 00:22:17,640
But the first part stood out to me.

864
00:22:17,640 --> 00:22:18,440
You knew how you felt?

865
00:22:18,440 --> 00:22:19,640
Yeah, I was sure.

866
00:22:20,200 --> 00:22:21,800
What about you? Did you have a choice?

867
00:22:21,800 --> 00:22:23,200
Not really.

